# Where the VALORANT catalog comes from

Everything here was checked on **2026-10-10**. `catalog.json` is the two-kind form
(`kinds`: Agents, then Guns; `../README.md`) in Fortnite's shape (D126), not
Siege's: in VALORANT **any agent can buy any gun**, so each agent's
`loadout.pool` is every gun, plus the agent's own ability weapon, and the Guns
kind has `"all": "All guns"`. A gun's Smart Actions set under All guns run
whatever agent is out; those set on an agent's page run only with that agent.
The catalog carries `review` (held for the owner's check, D132).

**Pictures: none.** Every `image` is `null` (no official artwork fetched this
round). A picture added later must come from Riot's own hosts.

## Sources used

